OL,3,GNEWSADriver jailed after death of
OL,4,Ateenage passenger
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 40-year-old man has been jailed after
OL,7,Fadmitting causing the death of a
OL,8,F13-year-old girl in a crash.
OL,10,FEvelyn Haylock was in the front
OL,11,Fpassenger seat of a car driven by
OL,12,FDwayne Moody when it crashed into a
OL,13,Ffield near Whitehill, Dane End,
OL,14,FHertfordshire, on 31 January.
OL,16,FThe resident of Tussers Court in
OL,17,FChelmsford, Essex, was sentenced to 12
OL,18,Fyears and six months in prison at St
OL,19,FAlbans Crown Court on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
